WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.607 --> 00:00:09.375 align:start position:0% line:0%
We thought we would
just have a walk about

00:00:09.408 --> 00:00:10.476 align:start size:97% position:3% line:0%
and see the damage

00:00:10.509 --> 00:00:11.778 align:start size:97% position:3% line:0%
that we've caused.

00:00:11.811 --> 00:00:13.613 align:start size:38% position:63%
Jelly there?

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:16.315
It's, like, there's paint of
several different colors.

00:00:16.348 --> 00:00:18.351 align:start position:0%
I thought this Jell-O
would've washed away by now,

00:00:18.384 --> 00:00:19.719 size:78% position:39%
but it doesn't rain much.

00:00:22.354 --> 00:00:23.723 align:start position:0%
That's the green one.

00:00:23.756 --> 00:00:28.227 align:end position:100%
The red one is still sort of
dripped down the front.

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:29.262 align:start position:0%
Whoa!

00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:32.231
- Oh!
- Oh, my God!

00:00:32.264 --> 00:00:33.266 align:start size:63% position:38%
And it smells awful.

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:35.101
I mean, look.

00:00:35.134 --> 00:00:38.337 align:end position:100%
Gravity has taken it
down this natural,
sort of like river,

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:40.239 align:end position:100%
so we've had
this stinky jelly river

00:00:40.272 --> 00:00:42.175 align:end position:100%
for about a week
and a half.

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:44.377
Slightly multi-colored,
full of balloons

00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:45.545
and balls.

00:00:45.578 --> 00:00:47.113
We'll pick all that up.

00:00:47.146 --> 00:00:48.614
Paint balls we've been
lobbing at the crew.

00:00:48.647 --> 00:00:50.416
We've never shown
behind the set.

00:00:50.449 --> 00:00:52.318
Why don't we take a walk
around here and see the damage?

00:00:54.653 --> 00:00:55.688
Nearly got it.

00:00:55.721 --> 00:00:57.190 align:start position:0%
Is that someone's food?

00:00:57.223 --> 00:00:58.725
There's an old burrito.

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:02.261 align:start position:0%
Who left the burrito?

00:01:02.294 --> 00:01:04.664 align:start position:0%
It tells a real story
of what's happened.

00:01:04.697 --> 00:01:07.267
Like, get...

00:01:08.734 --> 00:01:09.802 align:start size:97% position:3%
Hit him there.

00:01:09.835 --> 00:01:11.771
Uh, this is...

00:01:11.804 --> 00:01:13.439 align:start position:0%
Let's have a look
at what we've got.

00:01:13.472 --> 00:01:15.441
Oof, taking some rounds here.

00:01:15.474 --> 00:01:17.110 align:start position:0%
It's a very lethal set.

00:01:17.143 --> 00:01:19.712
So we've got water balloons.

00:01:19.745 --> 00:01:21.581
<i> Oh!</i>

00:01:21.614 --> 00:01:23.349 align:start position:0%
We've got bouncy balls.

00:01:23.382 --> 00:01:24.684
<i> Whoa!</i>

00:01:26.585 --> 00:01:28.154 size:78% position:39%
We've got a bowling ball.

00:01:28.187 --> 00:01:29.589 align:start size:97% position:3%
We've got jelly.

00:01:29.622 --> 00:01:30.890 align:start size:97% position:3%
Uh, paint.

00:01:30.923 --> 00:01:33.192 align:start position:0%
Oh, get a shot
of under here.

00:01:33.225 --> 00:01:34.794 align:start position:0%
Look at this.
Ping pong balls.

00:01:34.827 --> 00:01:37.363
- Look at that.
- That's where they were.

00:01:37.396 --> 00:01:40.733 align:start position:0%
It's also been
incredibly windy.

00:01:40.766 --> 00:01:43.803 align:end position:100%
My lungs are, well,
a quarter sand, probably.

00:01:43.836 --> 00:01:45.204 size:81% position:41%
Do you get sand boogies,

00:01:45.237 --> 00:01:46.372 align:start position:0%
like when the dust gets
in your nose?

00:01:46.405 --> 00:01:47.640
Disgusting.

00:01:47.673 --> 00:01:51.277
This is where we blew up
a load of det cord.

00:01:53.946 --> 00:01:55.481
- <i> Whoa. </i>
- <i> Whoa.</i>

00:01:55.514 --> 00:01:58.751
Gav:
<i>Whoa, look at the shock waves.</i>

00:01:58.784 --> 00:02:00.887 align:end position:100%
Look, that bucket that's just
been left in there

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:02.889 align:end position:100%
has even got an
industrial water sign on it.

00:02:02.922 --> 00:02:05.424 align:end position:100%
It just looks like someone's
left some industrial waste
in our set.

00:02:05.457 --> 00:02:08.227
If I stumbled upon this,
I'd be like, "What is this for?

00:02:08.260 --> 00:02:09.729 align:start size:59% position:41%
What happened here?

00:02:09.762 --> 00:02:10.897 size:88% position:56%
What's the purpose of this?"

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:12.865 align:end position:100%
And over here
we've got some--

00:02:12.898 --> 00:02:14.867 align:end position:100%
some of our vehicles
that we used.

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:16.669 align:start size:72% position:28%
These are our vehicles.

00:02:16.702 --> 00:02:18.437
This is an absolute fleet,
isn't it?

00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:20.273
So what we've
got, we've got--

00:02:20.306 --> 00:02:22.275
This is dropped
from a crane, then crushed

00:02:22.308 --> 00:02:23.743
and catapult video.

00:02:24.944 --> 00:02:26.913
( together )
<i> Oh!</i>

00:02:26.946 --> 00:02:28.447
<i> ( laughter )</i>

00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:30.383
<i> ( gasps )</i>

00:02:30.416 --> 00:02:32.585
Yeah, we really bullied
this one.

00:02:32.618 --> 00:02:34.387
Head-on crash, head-on crash.

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:36.622
- <i> What? </i>
- ( together ) <i> Oh!</i>

00:02:36.655 --> 00:02:38.291 align:start size:78% position:22%
This is from fruit stand.

00:02:40.326 --> 00:02:41.561
Oh!

00:02:41.594 --> 00:02:43.763 align:start position:0%
Oh, they still got
some fruit in there, look.

00:02:43.796 --> 00:02:46.465 align:start position:0%
Oh, there's wasps in it
and everything-- bees.

00:02:46.498 --> 00:02:49.802 align:end position:100%
And then over there we've got
our busted moving trucks.

00:02:51.337 --> 00:02:52.872
- <i> Ooh! </i>
- <i> Good night.</i>

00:02:54.273 --> 00:02:56.742
<i> Oh!</i>

00:02:56.775 --> 00:02:58.444 align:start position:0%
We went out of business
immediately.

00:02:58.477 --> 00:03:02.582
This accordion piece
is just blowing in the wind.

00:03:02.615 --> 00:03:04.951
Got these little location signs 
planted around the area.

00:03:04.984 --> 00:03:06.652 align:start size:50% position:50%
Brilliant, yeah.

00:03:06.685 --> 00:03:08.321 align:end position:100%
It's plastic, probably made
in about five minutes.

00:03:08.354 --> 00:03:10.223
- Yeah, we're still excited.
- Oh, a big moment.

00:03:10.256 --> 00:03:11.457
We've never had one before.

00:03:11.490 --> 00:03:13.226 align:end position:100%
I want to make one
just for myself.

00:03:13.259 --> 00:03:14.927
- Just put on your front door?
- "Dan's."

